---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Curriculum | Giulio Lattanzio"
  description="Curriculum digitale di Giulio Lattanzio: competenze in networking, Wi-Fi, Fortinet, VoIP, AudioCodes e analisi di rete."
>
  <div class="page-shell">
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="wrap nav-wrap">
        <a class="brand" href="/">
          <span class="brand-mark">GL</span>
          <span><strong>Giulio Lattanzio</strong><small>Network & Security Specialist</small></span>
        </a>
        <nav aria-label="Navigazione principale">
          <a href="/profilo/">Profilo</a>
          <a class="active" href="/curriculum/">Curriculum</a>
          <a href="/posts/">Articoli</a>
          <a href="/#stack">Tecnologie</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="wrap hero-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Curriculum digitale</p>
            <h1>Competenze, tecnologie e aree di esperienza.</h1>
            <p class="lead">
              Una panoramica sintetica del mio profilo tecnico. Questa pagina sarà aggiornata nel tempo insieme
              al mio percorso professionale, alle tecnologie che utilizzo e agli argomenti che approfondisco.
            </p>
          </div>
          <aside class="cv-card">
            <span class="prompt">C:\&gt; skills --summary</span>
            <div class="metric"><strong>5</strong><span>aree principali</span></div>
            <div class="metric"><strong>15+</strong><span>tecnologie e strumenti</span></div>
            <div class="metric"><strong>1</strong><span>knowledge hub in crescita</span></div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section white">
        <div class="wrap split">
          <div>
            <p class="section-label">Ruolo</p>
            <h2>Network & Security Specialist</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="copy">
            <p class="large">
              Attività focalizzate su networking, sicurezza, wireless enterprise e sistemi di comunicazione VoIP.
            </p>
            <p>
              Il profilo combina analisi e troubleshooting di rete, configurazione e gestione di tecnologie Fortinet,
              attività legate al mondo Wi-Fi e RF, sistemi SIP/VoIP e piattaforme AudioCodes SBC.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section soft">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="section-head">
            <p class="section-label">Competenze</p>
            <h2>Aree tecniche principali.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="skills-grid">
            <article><span>01</span><h3>Wi-Fi</h3><ul><li>Site Survey</li><li>Survey Wi-Fi</li><li>Analisi Wi-Fi</li><li>RF & roaming</li><li>Ekahau</li></ul></article>
            <article><span>02</span><h3>Fortinet</h3><ul><li>FortiGate</li><li>Security policy</li><li>VPN / IPsec</li><li>Segmentazione</li><li>Troubleshooting</li></ul></article>
            <article><span>03</span><h3>VoIP</h3><ul><li>SIP</li><li>Call flow</li><li>Routing</li><li>Interoperabilità</li><li>Troubleshooting</li></ul></article>
            <article><span>04</span><h3>AudioCodes</h3><ul><li>SBC</li><li>Routing SIP</li><li>Manipolazioni SIP</li><li>Microsoft Teams</li><li>Analisi chiamate</li></ul></article>
            <article><span>05</span><h3>Networking</h3><ul><li>VLAN</li><li>IP networking</li><li>Packet capture</li><li>Wireshark</li><li>Analisi traffico</li></ul></article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section white">
        <div class="wrap split">
          <div>
            <p class="section-label">Technology stack</p>
            <h2>Strumenti e piattaforme.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-list">
            <span>FortiGate</span><span>Fortinet</span><span>AudioCodes SBC</span><span>Ekahau</span>
            <span>SIP</span><span>VoIP</span><span>VLAN</span><span>IPsec</span><span>Wireshark</span>
            <span>Microsoft Teams</span><span>Enterprise Wi-Fi</span><span>Wi-Fi</span><span>Survey Wi-Fi</span>
            <span>Analisi Wi-Fi</span><span>Site Survey</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section dark">
        <div class="wrap next-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="section-label light-label">Esperienza dimostrata dai contenuti</p>
            <h2>Dal curriculum agli approfondimenti tecnici.</h2>
            <p>
              Gli articoli sono il complemento di questa pagina: permettono di documentare nel tempo analisi,
              concetti, procedure, appunti e approfondimenti tecnici sui temi che fanno parte del mio percorso.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a class="button light-button" href="/posts/">Esplora gli articoli →</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer><div class="wrap footer-wrap"><strong>Giulio Lattanzio</strong><span>Curriculum digitale</span></div></footer>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  :global(html){scroll-behavior:smooth}:global(body){margin:0}.page-shell{--navy:#0b1220;--blue:#2563eb;--text:#101828;--muted:#667085;--border:#e4e7ec;--soft:#f7f9fc;background:var(--soft);color:var(--text);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:0 auto}.topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:rgba(247,249,252,.92);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);backdrop-filter:blur(14px)}.nav-wrap{min-height:78px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;color:var(--text);text-decoration:none}.brand-mark{width:42px;height:42px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:12px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-weight:800}.brand strong,.brand small{display:block}.brand strong{font-size:14px}.brand small{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;margin-top:2px}nav{display:flex;gap:24px}nav a{text-decoration:none;color:#475467;font-size:14px;font-weight:650}.active,nav a:hover{color:var(--blue)}.hero{padding:105px 0 90px}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:80px;align-items:center}.eyebrow,.section-label{color:var(--blue);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}h1{margin:16px 0 0;max-width:760px;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(3rem,5vw,5rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.06em}.lead{max-width:760px;margin:28px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:18px;line-height:1.75}.cv-card{padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(16,24,40,.16)}.prompt{display:block;color:#60a5fa;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:26px}.metric{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid #27344b}.metric strong{font-size:34px}.metric span{color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px}.section{padding:105px 0}.white{background:#fff}.soft{background:var(--soft)}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:100px}.section h2{margin:14px 0 0;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(2.3rem,4vw,3.8rem);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.055em}.copy p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8}.copy .large{margin-top:0;color:var(--text);font-size:22px;line-height:1.5}.section-head{margin-bottom:46px}.skills-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-left:1px solid var(--border)}.skills-grid article{padding:26px;background:#fff;border-right:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.skills-grid article>span{color:var(--blue);font-family:monospace;font-size:12px}.skills-grid h3{margin:36px 0 18px;color:var(--navy);font-size:21px}.skills-grid ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.skills-grid li{padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid #eef1f5;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.stack-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}.stack-list span{padding:10px 13px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--soft);border-radius:8px;color:#344054;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px}.dark{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}.dark h2{color:#fff}.dark p:not(.section-label){color:#94a3b8;line-height:1.75;max-width:700px}.light-label{color:#60a5fa}.next-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:60px;align-items:end}.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:750}.light-button{background:#fff;color:var(--navy);white-space:nowrap}footer{background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}.footer-wrap{min-height:110px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.footer-wrap strong{color:var(--text)}@media(max-width:950px){.hero-grid,.split,.next-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:45px}.skills-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:700px){.wrap{width:min(100% - 28px,1160px)}nav a:nth-child(2),nav a:nth-child(4){display:none}.brand small{display:none}.hero{padding:70px 0}h1{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,13vw,4rem)}.lead{font-size:16px}.section{padding:78px 0}.skills-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.footer-wrap{padding:26px 0;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}}
</style>